{"id":"herbe","lemma":"herbe","pos":"noun","rank":1520,"glosses":["grass (the plant)","weed; marijuana; ganja; cannabis"],"ipa":"/ɛʁb/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b3/Fr-herbe.ogg/Fr-herbe.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"herbes"},"formAudio":{"herbes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ed/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-herbes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"L'herbe est mouillée.","en":"The grass is wet.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1095697","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"wet, moist","l":"mouillé"}]},{"text":"Ne marche pas sur l'herbe.","en":"Don't trample on the grass.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to walk","l":"marcher"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Notre jardin était plein de mauvaises herbes.","en":"Our garden was full of weeds.","words":[{"g":"our"},{"g":"garden"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"full, full up"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"bad","l":"mauvais"},null]},{"text":"Asseyons-nous ici sur l'herbe.","en":"Let's sit here on the grass.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/2499","words":[{"g":"to sit down","l":"asseoir"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Elle débarrassa le jardin des mauvaises herbes.","en":"She weeded the garden.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/69638","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to clear","l":"débarrasser"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"garden"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"bad","l":"mauvais"},null]}]}